---
// Component: Services.astro
// Showcase Mateo's two core services: Custom AI Chatbots & Custom Process Automation
---

<section id="servicios" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white border-b border-slate-200/60 relative overflow-hidden">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		
		<!-- Section Header -->
		<div class="max-w-3xl text-left mb-16 sm:mb-20 space-y-4">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200/80 text-teal-700 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
				<span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500 animate-pulse"></span>
				Servicios Especializados
			</div>
			
			<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
				Soluciones a medida para <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-600 via-cyan-600 to-emerald-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">eliminar la carga operativa</span>
			</h2>
			
			<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 font-normal leading-relaxed">
				Sin plantillas rígidas ni suscripciones infladas. Diseño e implemento infraestructura propia adaptada al 100% a las herramientas y flujos de tu empresa.
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Main Services Layout (2 Massive Dedicated Cards) -->
		<div class="space-y-16 lg:space-y-24">
			
			<!-- SERVICE 1: Chatbots con IA a Medida -->
			<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-950 to-slate-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 text-slate-100 shadow-2xl border border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden group">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start relative z-10">
					
					<!-- Service 1 Info (Left 7 Cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
						
						<!-- Header Badges -->
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
							<span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-400 bg-teal-950/80 border border-teal-500/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg">
								Agentes Conversacionales
							</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/30 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg">
								100% Self-Hosted (Sin Cuotas)
							</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Title & Description -->
						<div class="space-y-3">
							<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-display font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
								Chatbots con IA a Medida
							</h3>
							<p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
								Construidos desde cero con la voz y el conocimiento exacto de tu negocio. Olvídate de los menús rígidos de botones: tus clientes conversarán de forma fluida y natural, mientras el agente califica leads y ejecuta acciones en tu CRM.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Core USPs List -->
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
							<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-900/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80">
								<div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 shrink-0">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 0 1 4.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19 14.5M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19 14.5l-2.47 2.47a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.591.659H9.061a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-1.591-.659L5 14.5m14 0V17a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H7.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 5 17v-2.5" />
									</svg>
								</div>
								<div>
									<h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Entrenado con tus datos</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Absorbe manuales, catálogos y FAQs corporativas sin alucinar.</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-slate-900/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80">
								<div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 shrink-0">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5.25 14.25-1.05 6.3a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 0 3.182l5.25 5.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.182 0l5.25-5.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 0-3.182L14.25 14.25" />
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25-2.25H9.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 7.5 6.75v3.75m9 0v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H9.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V10.5m9 0h3a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 6.75v1.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.5 10.5h3" />
									</svg>
								</div>
								<div>
									<h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Sin cuotas por mensaje</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Instalación en tu propio servidor (VPS) sin depender de terceros.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Capabilities Checklist Grid -->
						<div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
							<h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Capacidades Destacadas:</h4>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									<span>Sincronización a CRM (HubSpot, Notion, Airtable)</span>
								</div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									<span>Derivación a Humano (Human Takeover)</span>
								</div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									<span>Auto-detección y respuesta multilingüe</span>
								</div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									<span>Seguimiento automático post-conversación</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Service 1 Interactive Visual / Channels Preview (Right 5 Cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-slate-900/90 rounded-2xl p-5 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 shadow-inner">
						
						<!-- Omnichannel Header -->
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
								  <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-teal-400 opacity-75"></span>
								  <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-teal-500"></span>
								</span>
								<span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider">Despliegue Omnicanal</span>
							</div>
							<span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-teal-400">Activo 24/7</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Channels Grid Pill Switcher -->
						<div class="space-y-3">
							<p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Canales de interacción disponibles:</p>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5">
								<!-- WhatsApp -->
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-colors">
									<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
										<svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347z"/><path d="M12 0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12c0 2.119.554 4.108 1.523 5.835L.055 23.445l5.772-1.514C7.478 22.842 9.664 23.4 12 23.4c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12S18.627 0 12 0zm0 21.4c-1.92 0-3.799-.515-5.441-1.49l-.39-.232-3.42.897.912-3.334-.254-.404C2.316 15.176 1.8 13.626 1.8 12 1.8 6.376 6.376 1.8 12 1.8c5.624 0 10.2 4.576 10.2 10.2S17.624 21.4 12 21.4z"/></svg>
									</div>
									<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">WhatsApp</span>
								</div>

								<!-- Telegram -->
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-colors">
									<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
										<svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12s5.37 12 12 12 12-5.37 12-12S18.63 0 12 0zm5.562 8.161c-.18.717-.962 4.084-1.362 5.753-.169.706-.43 1.053-.681 1.076-.549.051-.967-.362-1.5-.712-.835-.548-1.306-.889-2.117-1.424-.937-.618-.33-.958.204-1.513.14-.145 2.569-2.356 2.617-2.559.006-.025.01-.12-.045-.17-.056-.049-.138-.032-.198-.018-.084.019-1.424.906-4.018 2.658-.38.261-.724.389-1.032.382-.34-.007-1.002-.191-1.493-.351-.601-.196-1.08-.3-1.038-.634.022-.174.267-.352.736-.535 2.871-1.25 4.787-2.074 5.748-2.474 2.732-1.135 3.3-1.332 3.67-1.339.082-.001.264.02.382.116.099.081.127.191.14.269.013.078.028.255.015.394z"/></svg>
									</div>
									<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Telegram</span>
								</div>

								<!-- Web Widget -->
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-colors">
									<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
										<svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21a9 9 0 1 0 0-18 9 9 0 0 0 0 18zm0 0a15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-9 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-9 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 9 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 9zM2.5 9h19M2.5 15h19"/></svg>
									</div>
									<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">Widget Web</span>
								</div>

								<!-- Instagram DM / Slack / Email -->
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 hover:border-teal-500/50 transition-colors">
									<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
										<svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.625 12a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0zm0 0H8.25m4.125 0a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0zm0 0H12m4.125 0a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0zm0 0h-.375M21 12c0 4.556-4.03 8.25-9 8.25a9.764 9.764 0 0 1-2.555-.337A5.972 5.972 0 0 1 5.41 20.97a.596.596 0 0 1-.762-.762c.328-1.018.536-2.128.536-3.267C3.626 15.42 2.25 13.8 2.25 12c0-4.556 4.03-8.25 9-8.25s9 3.694 9 8.25z"/></svg>
									</div>
									<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white">IG DM & Slack</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Live Simulated Chat Card -->
						<div class="bg-slate-950 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-800 space-y-3">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-slate-900 pb-2">
								<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span>
								<span class="font-mono text-[11px]">Simulación en tiempo real</span>
							</div>

							<!-- Chat message 1 (User) -->
							<div class="flex justify-end">
								<div class="bg-teal-600/30 text-teal-100 text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-xl rounded-tr-xs max-w-[85%] border border-teal-500/30">
									"Hola, me gustaría saber si tenéis citas disponibles para mañana y precio de consulta."
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Chat message 2 (AI Bot Response) -->
							<div class="flex justify-start">
								<div class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-200 text-xs px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl rounded-tl-xs max-w-[90%] border border-slate-800 space-y-1.5">
									<p>¡Hola! Sí, tenemos hueco disponible a las 11:00h y a las 16:30h. La primera sesión incluye diagnóstico completo por 60€.</p>
									<div class="pt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-teal-400 border-t border-slate-800/80">
										<svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
										<span>Lead registrado en HubSpot CRM</span>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

					</div>

				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- SERVICE 2: Automatización de Procesos a Medida -->
			<div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 via-white to-teal-50/20 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 text-slate-800 shadow-xl border border-slate-200/90 relative overflow-hidden group">
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start relative z-10">
					
					<!-- Service 2 Info (Left 7 Cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
						
						<!-- Header Badges -->
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
							<span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal-700 bg-teal-100/80 border border-teal-300/80 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg">
								Ingeniería de Flujos Autónomos
							</span>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg">
								Python + n8n + APIs
							</span>
						</div>

						<!-- Title & Description -->
						<div class="space-y-3">
							<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-display font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
								Automatización de Procesos a Medida
							</h3>
							<p class="text-slate-655 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">
								Elimina las tareas manuales y repetitivas que malgastan horas de trabajo cada semana. Conecto tus herramientas existentes en flujos automatizados que ejecutan la operativa de tu empresa sin errores y sin descanso.
							</p>
						</div>

						<!-- Core USPs List -->
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
							<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
								<div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-teal-50 text-teal-600 shrink-0">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" />
									</svg>
								</div>
								<div>
									<h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Operativa 24/7 sin fallos</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Sistemas que trabajan continuamente mientras tu equipo escala.</p>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs">
								<div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-teal-50 text-teal-600 shrink-0">
									<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.19 8.688a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 1.242 7.244l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-6.364-6.364l1.757-1.757m13.35-.622 1.757-1.757a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-6.364-6.364l-4.5 4.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 1.242 7.244" />
									</svg>
								</div>
								<div>
									<h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Conexión con tus software</h4>
									<p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-0.5">Construido en torno a tus herramientas actuales, sin cambiarlas.</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Capabilities Grid (6 items) -->
						<div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
							<h4 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Casos de Automatización Frecuentes:</h4>
							<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-700">
								
								<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-white/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200/80">
									<div class="p-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 rounded mt-0.5">
										<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									</div>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold block">Captura y sincronización CRM</strong>
										<span class="text-slate-550 text-[11px]">Volcado automático de leads a HubSpot, Notion, Pipedrive.</span>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-white/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200/80">
									<div class="p-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 rounded mt-0.5">
										<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									</div>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold block">Facturación y cobros</strong>
										<span class="text-slate-550 text-[11px]">Generación de facturas en Holded/Stripe y avisos de cobro.</span>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-white/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200/80">
									<div class="p-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 rounded mt-0.5">
										<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									</div>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold block">Alertas y enrutamiento de Email</strong>
										<span class="text-slate-550 text-[11px]">Clasificación con IA y notificación inmediata en Slack/WhatsApp.</span>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 bg-white/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-200/80">
									<div class="p-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-700 rounded mt-0.5">
										<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
									</div>
									<div>
										<strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold block">Gestión de stock e inventario</strong>
										<span class="text-slate-550 text-[11px]">Alertas de reposición y comunicación con proveedores.</span>
									</div>
